#. module: repair_auto_print
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:repair_auto_print.field_stock_picking_type__done_repair_lot_zpl2_copies
msgid ""
"Default number of custom ZPL II lot/SN labels per repaired unit, "
"rounded up."
msgstr "每个维修产品单位默认打印的自定义 ZPL II 批次／序列号标签份数，维修数量向上取整。"

#. module: repair_auto_print
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:repair_auto_print.field_product_template__repair_product_zpl2_label_id
msgid "Repair Product ZPL II Label"
msgstr "维修产品 ZPL II 标签"

#. module: repair_auto_print
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:repair_auto_print.field_product_template__repair_product_zpl2_label_id
msgid ""
"Repair-specific product label shared by all variants. Leave empty "
"to use the repair operation type's default template."
msgstr "所有变体共用的维修专用产品标签。留空时使用维修作业类型的默认模板。"

#. module: repair_auto_print
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:repair_auto_print.field_product_template__repair_product_zpl2_copies
msgid "Repair Product Label Copies"
msgstr "维修产品标签份数"

#. module: repair_auto_print
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:repair_auto_print.field_product_template__repair_product_zpl2_copies
msgid ""
"Overrides the operation type's copies when greater than 0. "
"Set to 0 to inherit the operation type setting."
msgstr "大于 0 时覆盖作业类型份数，设为 0 时继承作业类型设置。"

#. module: repair_auto_print
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:repair_auto_print.field_product_template__done_repair_lot_zpl2_label_id
