"Repair-specific lot/SN label shared by all variants. Leave empty "
"to use the repair operation type's default template."
msgstr "所有变体共用的维修专用批次／序列号标签。留空时使用维修作业类型的默认模板。"

#. module: repair_auto_print
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:repair_auto_print.field_product_template__done_repair_lot_zpl2_copies
