"Overrides the operation type's copies when greater than 0. "
"Set to 0 to inherit the operation type setting."
msgstr "大于 0 时覆盖作业类型份数，设为 0 时继承作业类型设置。"

#. module: repair_auto_print
#: code:addons/repair_auto_print/models/stock_picking_type.py:79
msgid "%(field)s must be between 1 and 10."
msgstr "%(field)s 必须在 1 到 10 之间。"

#. module: repair_auto_print
#: code:addons/repair_auto_print/models/product_template.py:61
msgid ""
"%(field)s must be between 0 and 10 "
"(0 = inherit operation type setting)."
msgstr "%(field)s 必须在 0 到 10 之间（0 表示继承作业类型设置）。"

#. module: repair_auto_print
#: model:ir.ui.view,arch_db:repair_auto_print.view_product_template_form_repair_auto_print
msgid "ZPL Labels"
msgstr "ZPL 标签"

#. module: repair_auto_print
#: model:ir.ui.view,arch_db:repair_auto_print.view_product_template_form_repair_auto_print
msgid ""
"Leave a template empty to use the repair operation type default. "
"Set copies to 0 to inherit its quantity."
msgstr "模板留空时使用维修作业类型默认模板。份数设为 0 时继承作业类型设置。"

#. module: repair_auto_print
#: code:addons/repair_auto_print/models/repair_order.py:59
msgid ""
"ZPL II label '%(label)s' for repair '%(repair)s' has an "
"unsupported model: %(model)s."
msgstr "维修“%(repair)s”的 ZPL II 标签“%(label)s”使用了不支持的模型：%(model)s。"

#. module: repair_auto_print
#: code:addons/repair_auto_print/models/repair_order.py:59
msgid ""
"No printer is configured for ZPL II label '%(label)s' on "
"repair '%(repair)s'. Configure a user-label printer, the "
"label's default printer, or your default label printer."
msgstr "维修“%(repair)s”的 ZPL II 标签“%(label)s”未配置打印机。请配置用户标签打印机、标签默认打印机或当前用户的默认标签打印机。"

#. module: repair_auto_print
#: code:addons/repair_auto_print/models/repair_order.py:59
msgid ""
"Printer '%(printer)s' for ZPL II label '%(label)s' on "
"repair '%(repair)s' is not available (status: %(status)s)."
msgstr "维修“%(repair)s”的 ZPL II 标签“%(label)s”所选打印机“%(printer)s”不可用（状态：%(status)s）。"
